-- Typed AST -> Core lowering for the Blorp-owned frontend.
--
-- This starts with the phase-boundary primitives shared by every lowering
-- case: source locations, type conversion, stable variables, and simple
-- expressions/declarations. Unsupported shapes return explicit errors so the
-- production handoff cannot silently produce partial Core.
